 {"model": "app.faq", "pk": 5, "fields": {"question": "Do you provide admission support for Indian colleges?", "answer": "Yes, we assist students with admissions across India."}}, {"model": "app.testimonial", "pk": 1, "fields": {"image": "images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-06_at_9.20.41_AM.jpeg", "rating": 5, "name": "Reshma Jeena", "feedback": "Had a great experience with SpeakAbroad during my application process. My counselors Shahana and Shan was very supportive, responsive, and guided me through every step clearly. Especially Shahana patiently answered all my questions regarding university selection, documentation, and visa procedures. The process felt much smoother with her help. I really appreciate their dedication and professionalism.", "studied_at": "Abroad"}}, {"model": "app.testimonial", "pk": 2, "fields": {"image": "images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-06_at_9.14.50_AM.jpeg", "rating": 5, "name": "Priju John Bright", "feedback": "I am  currently in the UK, and I completed my admission process through Speakabroad, one of the best study abroad consultancies in Kollam.\r\n\r\nI got admission to Chester University, and the entire process was smooth and well-managed. Speakabroad provided complete guidance for study abroad, including university selection, application process, and visa support. They were with me throughout every step of the journey.A special thanks to Shan Sir and Shahna Maam for their continuous support. They didn’t feel like consultants, but more like a brother and sister, always ready to clear every doubt without hesitation.", "studied_at": "Abroad"}}, {"model": "app.testimonial", "pk": 3, "fields": {"image": "images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-06_at_9.26.42_AM.jpeg", "rating": 5, "name": "Muhammed Noufal", "feedback": "I am extremely happy to share my experience with SpeakAbroad, Kollam, for helping me achieve my dream of studying in the UK. I am from Kollam, and with the excellent guidance of SpeakAbroad, I successfully received my UK student visa for MSc at the University of Hertfordshire.\r\n\r\nFrom the very beginning, the team was professional, supportive, and transparent throughout the UK study abroad process. A special thanks to my mentor Shan Sir and Shahna Ma’am for their constant guidance, motivation, and clear explanations at every stage—from course selection to visa documentation.", "studied_at": "India"}}, {"model": "app.testimonial", "pk": 4, "fields": {"image": "images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-06_at_11.35.10_AM.jpeg", "rating": 5, "name": "Shalatt Das", "feedback": "I had a really great experience with Speak Abroad. The entire process was smooth and stress-free because they were always reachable whenever I had doubts or needed guidance. Their support and prompt responses made everything much easier for me. A special thanks to Haris Sir and Shanana Ma’am — they were exceptionally supportive, patient, and genuinely helpful throughout the journey. I truly appreciate their dedication and guidance. Highly recommended for anyone planning to study abroad.", "studied_at": "Abroad"}}, {"model": "app.graduate", "pk": 2, "fields": {"image": "images/JINSON_THATTARAPPARAMBIL_THOMAS.jpeg", "name": "Jinson Thattarapparambil Thomas", "university": "University of Chester", "course": "MSc International Business", "country": null, "studied_at": "Abroad"}}, {"model": "app.graduate", "pk": 3, "fields": {"image": "images/Aparna_Shaji.jpeg", "name": "Aparna Shaji", "university": "University of Lancashire", "course": "MBA with Professional placement", "country": null, "studied_at": "Abroad"}}, {"model": "app.graduate", "pk": 4, "fields": {"image": "images/Leya_Anna_Tom.jpeg", "name": "Leya Anna Tom", "university": "Anglia Ruskin University", "course": "MPH Global Public Health", "country": null, "studied_at": "Abroad"}}, {"model": "app.graduate", "pk": 5, "fields": {"image": "images/name.jpeg", "name": "Aiswarya Janardhan Pillai", "university": "University Of East London", "course": "MBA Project Management", "country": null, "stu